# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides, or set in your host's dashboard.
#
# Where the API lives. Leave blank for local development: the Vite dev server
# proxies /api to localhost:8000, which keeps the browser on one origin and
# stops the activity stream from being buffered.
#
# Set this when the frontend is deployed somewhere the API is not. No trailing
# slash, and it must be https if the site is, or the browser blocks the calls.
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://polimap-api.onrender.com
#
# Whatever origin the frontend ends up on also has to be added to CORS_ORIGINS
# in the API's own environment, or every request fails at the browser.
VITE_API_BASE=